      "title": "uet: fix TSS with entropy header",
      "message": "uet: fix TSS with entropy header\n\nWhen the entropy header is present the dissection function does not take\ninto account the offset of this header.\nThis is fixed by matching the function to existing conventions of\ninternal helper functions and adding an offset parameter.\n\nAI-Assisted: No\n",
